VALUES
('Sigiriya and Pidurangala Sunrise','sigiriya-pidurangala-sunrise','A high-intent Sri Lanka experience combining the archaeological Sigiriya climb with the sunrise view from Pidurangala.','This experience is designed for travelers who want the famous Sigiriya view and the actual UNESCO fortress story without rushing either site. Start before heat builds, keep water ready, and use a private driver so the timing works cleanly.','Sigiriya, Pidurangala, Dambulla, Habarana, and Minneriya routes.','["Start before sunrise for Pidurangala.","Keep Sigiriya for early morning or late afternoon.","Wear proper shoes and carry water."]','Best in dry mornings from January to September.',NULL,NULL,'Sigiriya and Pidurangala Sunrise Experience','Plan Sigiriya Rock and Pidurangala sunrise with private timing, safe transfers, and Cultural Triangle route links.',NULL,'Plan Sigiriya Sunrise','Add Sigiriya and Pidurangala to a private Cultural Triangle tour.',10,1,1),
('Kandy to Ella Scenic Train','kandy-to-ella-train','The famous hill-country train segment with private road support for luggage, timing, comfort, and flexible stops.','The Kandy to Ella train is one of Sri Lanka''s most searched experiences, but it is slow and tickets can be limited. A private route can combine the best rail section with road support so travelers keep comfort and timing.','Kandy, Nanu Oya, Nuwara Eliya, Haputale, Ella.','["Reserve seats early where possible.","Use a driver for luggage and hotel-to-station timing.","Consider a shorter scenic train section if the full ride is too long."]','Best with morning departures and clear hill-country weather.',NULL,NULL,'Kandy to Ella Train with Private Driver Support','Plan Sri Lanka''s scenic train route with private vehicle backup, luggage support, and highland stops.',NULL,'Plan the Scenic Train Day','Use the train where it adds value and keep private support for the rest.',20,1,1),
('Yala Leopard Safari','yala-leopard-safari','A classic Sri Lanka wildlife experience focused on Yala National Park, leopard habitat, elephants, and southern route planning.','Yala is famous for leopard-focused safari drives, but responsible timing and realistic expectations matter. This experience works best with an overnight near the park and a pre-dawn start.','Yala, Tissamaharama, Kataragama, Bundala, Tangalle.','["Use early-morning safaris for better conditions.","Avoid operators that crowd animals.","Pair with Tangalle or Ella for smoother routing."]','February to July is often strong, but wildlife is never guaranteed.',NULL,NULL,'Yala Leopard Safari Experience in Sri Lanka','Plan a Yala leopard safari with ethical timing, private transfers, and south-coast or hill-country route links.',NULL,'Plan a Yala Safari','Add a realistic wildlife day to your Sri Lanka route.',30,1,1),
('Udawalawe Elephant Safari','udawalawe-elephant-safari','Family-friendly elephant safari experience with easier wildlife pacing than many longer park routes.','Udawalawe is one of Sri Lanka''s most practical wildlife experiences for families and first-time safari travelers. The open terrain makes elephant viewing more consistent.','Udawalawe, Elephant Transit Home, Ella, Tangalle, Galle.','["Good for families and first-time safari travelers.","Keep enough buffer between transfer and safari.","Use neutral clothing and bring sun protection."]','Works year-round with dry months often improving visibility.',NULL,NULL,'Udawalawe Elephant Safari Experience','Plan Udawalawe elephant safaris with private transfers, family-friendly timing, and route support.',NULL,'Plan an Elephant Safari','Include Udawalawe in a private wildlife route.',40,1,1),
('Minneriya Elephant Gathering','minneriya-elephant-gathering','Seasonal elephant safari experience near Sigiriya, tied to the famous dry-season gathering around the tank.','Minneriya and nearby Kaudulla form a key elephant corridor near the Cultural Triangle. The best park can vary, so local routing should stay flexible.','Sigiriya, Habarana, Minneriya, Kaudulla, Dambulla.','["July to October is the well-known Gathering period.","Use the best current park, not a fixed name only.","Pair with Sigiriya and Dambulla."]','Usually strongest from July to October, with local variation.',NULL,NULL,'Minneriya Elephant Gathering Safari','Plan the Minneriya or Kaudulla elephant safari from Sigiriya with flexible private transport.',NULL,'Plan the Elephant Gathering','Add the right elephant park to your Cultural Triangle stay.',50,1,1),
('Galle Fort Walk and Southern Coast','galle-fort-southern-coast','A heritage walking experience through Galle Fort paired with beaches, cafes, villas, and south-coast transfers.','Galle Fort is a high-value stop because it combines UNESCO heritage with easy food, shopping, and beach access. A private route keeps the fort walk at the cooler time of day.','Galle, Unawatuna, Hikkaduwa, Weligama, Mirissa.','["Walk the ramparts near sunset.","Use Galle as a base for Unawatuna or Hikkaduwa.","Book popular restaurants in peak season."]','Best for the south coast from November to April; fort walks work year-round.',NULL,NULL,'Galle Fort and Southern Coast Experience','Plan Galle Fort walks, beach links, cafes, villas, and private south-coast transfers.',NULL,'Plan Galle and the South Coast','Use Galle as the heritage anchor of a beach route.',60,1,1),
('Mirissa Whale Watching','mirissa-whale-watching','Seasonal south-coast marine experience with early departures, beach time, and responsible operator selection.','Mirissa whale watching is popular, but the best experience depends on sea conditions, operator behavior, and realistic expectations. It should be paired with enough rest time after the early start.','Mirissa, Weligama, Matara, Galle.','["Choose responsible boats.","Expect an early start.","Keep the afternoon flexible after the trip."]','Best in the main south-coast season from November to April.',NULL,NULL,'Mirissa Whale Watching Experience','Plan Mirissa whale watching, beaches, and private south-coast timing with responsible operator guidance.',NULL,'Plan Whale Watching','Add Mirissa marine time to a private beach route.',70,1,1),
('Tea Country and Nuwara Eliya','tea-country-nuwara-eliya','Tea estates, cool weather, factory visits, waterfalls, and highland scenery between Kandy and Ella.','Tea country gives long-haul travelers a completely different Sri Lanka pace. Use it to slow the route, not just as a quick photo stop.','Kandy, Nuwara Eliya, Nanu Oya, Ella, Haputale.','["Carry warm layers.","Keep train and tea stops realistic.","Use private road support for viewpoints."]','January to April is popular; mornings are best for views.',NULL,NULL,'Tea Country and Nuwara Eliya Experience','Plan Sri Lanka tea country with estates, cool weather, waterfalls, train segments, and private hill-country transfers.',NULL,'Plan Tea Country','Add highland scenery to your Sri Lanka itinerary.',80,1,1),
('South Coast Surf Lessons','south-coast-surf-lessons','Beginner-friendly surf lessons in Weligama and nearby south-coast breaks with beach time and villa stays.','Surf lessons are one of the most searched active experiences in Sri Lanka. Weligama is especially useful for beginners, while Ahangama and Midigama suit progressing surfers.','Weligama, Ahangama, Midigama, Mirissa, Hikkaduwa, Arugam Bay.','["Match the beach to the traveler''s level.","Do not overschedule after lessons.","Use reef-safe sunscreen."]','South coast is strongest from November to April; Arugam Bay is stronger mid-year.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lanka Surf Lessons and South Coast Experience','Plan Weligama surf lessons, Ahangama cafes, Mirissa beaches, and private south-coast travel.',NULL,'Plan Surf Time','Add beginner or progression surf days to a private route.',90,0,1),
('Sri Lankan Food and Market Tour','sri-lankan-food-market-tour','Local food, markets, cooking, spices, tea, seafood, and home-style meals woven into a private route.','Food experiences help a route feel human rather than checklist-driven. This can be a Colombo, Galle, Kandy, or village-style add-on depending on the itinerary.','Colombo, Galle, Kandy, Sigiriya villages, Ella, Matale.','["Ask about spice tolerance.","Keep market visits early.","Combine food with local family or village experiences where appropriate."]','Works year-round.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lankan Food and Market Experience','Plan Sri Lankan food walks, markets, cooking, spices, tea, and local meals inside a private itinerary.',NULL,'Plan a Food Experience','Add real local flavor to your Sri Lanka journey.',100,0,1),
('Ayurveda and Wellness Retreat','ayurveda-wellness-retreat','Wellness, Ayurveda, yoga, spa time, and slower stays for couples, high-spend travelers, and recovery days.','Wellness works best when it is built into the route pacing, not squeezed between long transfers. Use it for beach endings, hill-country recovery, or dedicated retreats.','Bentota, Tangalle, Galle, Kandy, Ayurveda resorts, wellness villas.','["Allow at least two nights for meaningful rest.","Check treatment intensity before booking.","Separate wellness days from long transfer days."]','Year-round depending on the chosen coast or retreat area.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lanka Ayurveda and Wellness Retreat Experience','Plan Ayurveda, yoga, spa stays, and slower private Sri Lanka routes for couples and wellness travelers.',NULL,'Plan Wellness Time','Add a restorative wellness stop to your itinerary.',110,0,1),
('Buddhist Heritage and Pilgrimage','buddhist-heritage-pilgrimage','Sacred Buddhist sites, temple etiquette, ancient capitals, and pilgrimage routes across the Cultural Triangle and hill country.','Buddhist heritage is one of Sri Lanka''s strongest cultural themes. A private route can connect Kandy, Anuradhapura, Dambulla, Polonnaruwa, and Mihintale with respectful timing.','Kandy, Anuradhapura, Dambulla, Polonnaruwa, Mihintale, Adam''s Peak.','["Dress respectfully at temples.","Plan barefoot temple surfaces around heat.","Use a knowledgeable guide for context."]','Works year-round, with early starts in hotter regions.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lanka Buddhist Heritage and Pilgrimage Experience','Plan sacred Buddhist sites, ancient capitals, temple etiquette, and private pilgrimage-style tours.',NULL,'Plan a Heritage Route','Build a respectful Buddhist heritage itinerary.',120,0,1),
('Honeymoon Beach and Boutique Stays','honeymoon-beach-boutique-stays','A slower romantic experience focused on boutique hotels, scenic drives, beach endings, villas, and private pacing.','Honeymoon travelers usually need fewer stops, better hotels, and more breathing room. This experience connects the right destinations without making the trip feel like a checklist.','Sigiriya, Kandy, Ella, Galle, Tangalle, Bentota, Maldives extension.','["Avoid one-night stops where possible.","Keep at least one slow beach finish.","Use private transfers for comfort and privacy."]','Best coast depends on month: south/west from November to April, east from May to September.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lanka Honeymoon Experience with Boutique Stays','Plan a private Sri Lanka honeymoon with boutique hotels, scenic routes, beaches, and relaxed pacing.',NULL,'Plan a Honeymoon Route','Create a slower private route for couples.',130,1,1),
('Family Wildlife and Beach Route','family-wildlife-beach-route','A family-focused experience balancing animals, short drives, beach time, pool stays, and flexible private support.','Family routes need realistic drive times, easy food, good vehicle comfort, and flexible sightseeing. Sri Lanka works well when wildlife and beach days are balanced.','Negombo, Sigiriya, Kandy, Udawalawe, Galle, Bentota, Tangalle.','["Keep two-night stays where possible.","Use Udawalawe for reliable elephant appeal.","Build pool and beach time into the route."]','Works year-round with coast choice adjusted by month.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lanka Family Wildlife and Beach Experience','Plan family-friendly Sri Lanka wildlife, beaches, cultural stops, and private vehicle pacing.',NULL,'Plan a Family Route','Build a comfortable private itinerary for children and adults.',140,1,1),
('Luxury Slow Travel Sri Lanka','luxury-slow-travel-sri-lanka','High-spend private routing with fewer hotels, better experiences, boutique properties, villas, and unhurried timing.','Luxury travelers usually get more value from depth than distance. This experience focuses on selective routing, excellent stays, better guides, and fewer rushed transfers.','Sigiriya, tea country, Galle, Tangalle, Bentota, wellness retreats, private villas.','["Use fewer overnight bases.","Prioritize guide quality and hotel fit.","Leave open time for weather and rest."]','Year-round with coast choice by season.',NULL,NULL,'Luxury Slow Travel Sri Lanka Experience','Plan high-end Sri Lanka private tours with boutique hotels, villas, wellness, and slower route design.',NULL,'Plan a Luxury Route','Create a high-comfort private Sri Lanka journey.',150,1,1),
('Sinharaja and Birding Nature','sinharaja-birding-nature','Rainforest, birding, endemic wildlife, and specialist nature routes for travelers who want more than standard safari.','Nature travelers often need different pacing from general sightseeing. Sinharaja, Bundala, Mannar, and highland habitats can be woven into a specialist route.','Sinharaja, Bundala, Mannar, Horton Plains, Kitulgala, Kumana.','["Use specialist guides for birding.","Check rain and access conditions.","Keep camera and leech protection ready in rainforest areas."]','Best timing depends on habitat and rainfall; early starts are essential.',NULL,NULL,'Sri Lanka Birding and Rainforest Experience','Plan Sinharaja, Bundala, Mannar, Kumana, and specialist nature routes with private transfers.',NULL,'Plan a Nature Route','Add birding and rainforest depth to your itinerary.',160,0,1)
